/* ============================================================================
   COMMUNITY & ECOSYSTEM PARTNERS
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Confirmed partners render as official showcase cards on the Partners page.
   To add a new partner, append an object to the `partners` array below.

   Properties per partner:
   - id: Unique string identifier (e.g. "gdg-kolkata")
   - name: Community or organization name (required)
   - category: Tier or badge label (e.g. "Community Partner", "Campus Chapter", "Media Partner", "Tooling Partner")
   - description: Brief description of the partner / mission
   - logo: Imported image asset (e.g. `import myLogo from "../assets/pics/logo.png"`)
           or direct image URL string (e.g. "https://...").
           If omitted or null, an initials badge renders automatically.
   - logoAlt: Alt text for the logo (default: `${name} logo`)
   - brandColor: Hex code for brand glow effect (default: "#5ef2d6")
   - accentColor: Accent highlight color (default: "#5ef2d6")
   - logoScale: Scale multiplier for logo image sizing (default: 1)
   - website: Website or community link (opens in new tab)
   - city: Location / city (e.g. "Kolkata")
   - reach: Optional audience/member count (e.g. "2,000+ members")
   ========================================================================== */

